# AI, ML & Data Science branch ai-ml-datascience

## 📌 Purpose
This branch is dedicated to experiments, tutorials, and resources in **Artificial Intelligence (AI)**, 
**Machine Learning (ML)**, and **Data Science**.  
It provides a clean space to explore models, datasets, and workflows without mixing them into the main project history.

## 📂 Structure
- **/ai** → Projects focusing on intelligent systems (chatbots, NLP, computer vision).
- **/ml** → Algorithms and models (classification, regression, clustering, reinforcement learning).
- **/data-science** → Data cleaning, visualization, statistical analysis, and exploratory notebooks.

